  "title": "At the doctor's",
  "goal": "Say what someone must or should do with -mAlI: gitmelisin, dinlenmeliyim, içmemelisin.",
  "points": ["gp-meli"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Add `-mAlI` and the endings of the present to say what someone must or should do: *gitmeliyim* (I must go), *dinlenmelisin* (you should rest). The negative puts `-mA` first: *gitmemelisin* (you mustn't go). In questions the ending goes on `mI`: *Gitmeli miyim?*",
    "see": "gp-meli"
  },
